  "story": {
    "text": "Anne Steele lets the secret slip, and Fanny falls into {HYSTERICS}. Mrs. Ferrars orders Edward to give Lucy up; he will not break his word, so she {DISINHERITS} him, and settles everything on Robert. Marianne learns that Elinor has known for four {MONTHS}, and kept {SILENT}. “Four months!” She {WEEPS}, ashamed of her own {SELFISHNESS}.",
